@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed actual-material capture — coordination obligations
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Authorized user" as U
participant "Applications handler" as A
participant "Files public contract" as F
database "Owned application state" as DB
U -> A : explicit actual-event/material intent
A -> A : current authority + command/version checks
A -> F : pin/validate exact material + protect reference
note over A,F
 Evaluate reservation/finalization and cleanup exclusion together.
 This diagram does not assume atomicity across owners.
end note
F --> A : actual usable/pending/unavailable reference evidence
A -> DB : bounded event/manifest/completeness + command result
DB --> A : attributable commit outcome
A -> F : finalize/reconcile protected reference by capture identity
note over A,F
 Lost/partial acknowledgments require durable reconciliation.
 Do not claim complete usable history prematurely.
end note
A --> U : permitted actual event + material-completeness result
note over A,DB
 No implicit send, live publication or sharing-link change.
 Repeated same command resolves the prior permitted result.
end note
@enduml
